; The arms of a value answer ONE type: an integer arm beside a floating-point
; one is not widened into it, the conversion is written. Before 2026-11-10
; the binding was dropped at rc 0 (Planner.report_value_arms#).
; xfail: the arms of this value are i32 and f32

function f(c: i32, k: i32, x: f32) returns int
{
    let v if c > k: k else x
    7
}

if f(9, 7, 1.0) = 7
    print "PASS"
